<title>SWITZERLAND: TENNIS-SWISS INDOOR TENNIS CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWISS INDOOR TENNIS CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results</p>
<p>from the Swiss Indoor tennis championships on Thursday (prefix</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat Tommy Haas (Germany) 6-4 2-6 6-3</p>
<p>3-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Lionel Roux (France) 4-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Olivier Delaitre (France) beat Renzo Furlan (Italy) 1-6 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Jiri Novak (Czech Republic) beat 4-Boris Becker (Germany) 6-3</p>
<p>7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Marc Goellner (Germany) beat 6-Stefan Edberg (Sweden) 7-6 (9-7)</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Hendrik Dreekmann (Germany) beat Magnus Larsson (Sweden) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5) 6-3</p>
<p>Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat David Prinosil (Germany) 6-4</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Mikael Tillstrom (Sweden) beat Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>6-3</p>
</text>
